WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.753
Coworker Conflict.

2
00:00:01.753 --> 00:00:03.564
A coworker criticizes your work

3
00:00:03.564 --> 00:00:07.163
sharply in front of others. What do you do? A...

4
00:00:07.163 --> 00:00:09.764
Criticize their work back. B...

5
00:00:09.764 --> 00:00:12.852
Avoid them for the rest of the week. C...

6
00:00:12.852 --> 00:00:15.708
Stay professional, address the issue privately,

7
00:00:15.708 --> 00:00:18.437
and focus on the work concern. D...

8
00:00:18.437 --> 00:00:20.352
Immediately report them without attempting

9
00:00:20.352 --> 00:00:21.966
